Revision history for Perl module Locale::Unicode::RBNF

v0.1.0 2026-10-23T21:10:33+0900
    - Initial release: port from ICU4C 79.1 RuleBasedNumberFormat (rbnf.cpp, nfrs.cpp,
      nfrule.cpp, nfsubs.cpp), with a loader for the CLDR RBNF, number symbols, numbering
      systems and plural rules data.
